OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth told he has 'no
OL,4,Amandate on independence' by Reform at
OL,5,ASenedd questions
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Senedd has returned after an
OL,8,Feight-week summer break in which parts
OL,9,Fof Wales were hit with wildfires, and
OL,10,Fthe country fell behind other UK
OL,11,Fcountries with Pisa education results
OL,13,FYou can watch the Senedd session live
OL,14,Fby clicking play at the top of this
OL,15,Fpage from 13:30 BST
